WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.808
Today we will explore repeated structure through weaving. Our work connects with

00:00:04.808 --> 00:00:07.496
international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:11.247
Lay parallel paper strips on a desk as the base.

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:14.799
Pass one strip over then under the base strips.

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:21.155
Repeat the sequence and straighten the finished pattern. Justify a revision using

00:00:21.155 --> 00:00:23.151
evidence from another world tradition.
